From 6608d9c67cfce0bcc0ff3c0feda32899b1d58907 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexandre Cassen <acassen@corp.free.fr>
Date: Wed, 25 Mar 2026 10:29:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] net/mlx5e: Support TC offload rx_queue action to NIC flow

Add TC offload support for FLOW_ACTION_RX_QUEUE_MAPPING in NIC mode.
A new act handler (rx_queue.c) validates the queue index against the
number of channels and resolves it to the corresponding direct TIR,
which is then used as the flow rule destination.

Signed-off-by: Alexandre Cassen <acassen@corp.free.fr>
